      "text": "許棠把咖啡換到另一隻手，往旁邊讓了一點，給要拿商品的人過。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_tell_eat_better_05"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_tell_eat_better_05": {
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "……嗯，當我沒說。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_tell_eat_better_06"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_tell_eat_better_06": {
      "speaker": "許棠",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_tell_eat_better_07"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_tell_eat_better_07": {
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "text": "兩人各自看了幾秒架上的東西。這句話就停在那裡。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_work"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_work": {
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "text": "結帳區的微波爐開始運轉。兩人往前挪了幾步，先後排到櫃檯旁邊。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_work_02"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_work_02": {
      "speaker": "許棠",
      "text": "你剛剛說弄完事情，是工作？",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_work_03"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_work_03": {
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "嗯。做軟體的，今晚有東西要上線，弄到剛剛。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_work_04"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_work_04": {
      "speaker": "許棠",
      "text": "喔，辛苦。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_work_05"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_work_05": {
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "還好啦。我大部分時間在家工作，省掉通勤。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_work_06"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_work_06": {
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "text": "微波爐還有一分多鐘。兩人都看著轉盤轉了一圈，沒有立刻接話。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_work_07"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_work_07": {
      "speaker": "許棠",
      "text": "我還沒弄完。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_work_08"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_work_08": {
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "啊。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_work_09"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_work_09": {
      "speaker": "許棠",
      "text": "客戶明早要看最後一版。過了就送印。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_work_10"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_work_10": {
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "妳做印刷的？",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_work_11"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_work_11": {
      "speaker": "許棠",
      "text": "不是。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_work_12"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_work_12": {
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "text": "她搖了一下頭。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_work_13"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_work_13": {
      "speaker": "許棠",
      "text": "視覺設計。自己接案。這個案子剛好要印。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_work_14"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_work_14": {
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "喔，懂了。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_work_15"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_work_15": {
      "speaker": "許棠",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_work_16"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_work_16": {
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "text": "微波爐提示音響起。許棠抬頭看了一眼。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_work_17"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_work_17": {
      "speaker": "許棠",
      "text": "我的好了。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_checkout"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_checkout": {
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "text": "許棠先拿回自己的餐盒，和咖啡一起結帳。男主還在等自己的加熱完成；等他走出店門時，她正站在騎樓邊把收據塞進袋子。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_checkout_02"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_checkout_02": {
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "text": "兩人往同一個方向走。路口還有剛下過雨的水光，前半段誰也沒有特地找話。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_checkout_03"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_checkout_03": {
      "speaker": "許棠",
      "text": "對了。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_checkout_04"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_checkout_04": {
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "text": "走到巷口，她朝右邊還亮著燈的店面抬了抬下巴。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_checkout_05"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_checkout_05": {
      "speaker": "許棠",
      "text": "那間粥店開到十二點。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_checkout_06"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_checkout_06": {
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "哪間？",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_checkout_07"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_checkout_07": {
      "speaker": "許棠",
      "text": "白色招牌那間。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_checkout_08"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_checkout_08": {
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "喔。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_checkout_09"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_checkout_09": {
      "speaker": "許棠",
      "text": "週三休。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_checkout_10"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_checkout_10": {
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "妳怎麼記那麼清楚？",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_checkout_11"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_checkout_11": {
      "speaker": "許棠",
      "text": "因為我上次週三走過去。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_checkout_12"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_checkout_12": {
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "……好，這種會記得。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_checkout_13"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_checkout_13": {
      "speaker": "許棠",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_checkout_14"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_checkout_14": {
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "text": "過了路口後，兩人又安靜了一小段。許棠沒有往粥店轉，繼續往公寓方向走。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_exit"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_exit": {
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "text": "進大樓後，兩人一起搭電梯上 17 樓。這次一路正常，沒有人特地把沉默填滿。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_exit_02"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_exit_02": {
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "text": "電梯門打開。許棠走到 1702 前，從袋子裡摸出鑰匙。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_exit_03"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_exit_03": {
      "speaker": "許棠",
      "text": "我先進去了。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_exit_04"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_exit_04": {
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_exit_05"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_exit_05": {
      "speaker": "許棠",
      "text": "還有兩版。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_exit_06"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_exit_06": {
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "好。晚安。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_exit_07"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_exit_07": {
      "speaker": "許棠",
      "text": "晚安。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "common_convenience_xu_exit_08"
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_exit_08": {
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "text": "她進 1702。男主繼續往 1703 走。",
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "next": "opening_demo_complete",
      "entryEffects": {
        "F_XT": 1
      },
      "entryFlags": [
        "player_knows_xu_freelance_creative_work",
        "xu_knows_player_remote_tech_work"
      ]
    },
    "common_convenience_xu_choice": {
      "chapter": 3,
      "visual": {
        "mode": "composite",
        "background": "bg.narrative_preview.placeholder",
        "sprites": []
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "com02x_ask_food",
          "text": "附近這個時間，還有別的店開著嗎？",
