          "effects": {
            "F_XT": 1,
            "mc_tone_practical": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "com02x_share_work",
          "text": "我也剛收工。現在能微波就算有煮了。",
          "next": "common_convenience_xu_share_work",
          "effects": {
            "T_XT": 1,
            "mc_tone_humorous": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "com02x_tease_same",
          "text": "妳那盒至少比我這個像一餐。",
          "next": "common_convenience_xu_tease_same",
          "effects": {
            "C_XT": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "com02x_tell_eat_better",
          "text": "妳如果常常都拖到這麼晚才吃，還是要注意一下吧。",
          "next": "common_convenience_xu_tell_eat_better",
